    "text": "<p>Two independent harmonic oscillators of equal mass are oscillating about the origin with angular frequencies <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ω</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and have total energies <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> , respectively. The variations of their momenta <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> with positions <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> are shown in the figures. If <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> , then the correct equation(s) is (are)<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image10-cec115ad-7e25-4320-a012-eabe44823b93.png\"/></p>",
