    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math